~ start

Nyan: Welcome back.
Nyan: You should visit the Seed Shop and buy 5 Corn Seeds.

=> END


~ progress

Nyan: The Seed Shop is nearby.
Nyan: Buy 5 Corn Seeds and come back to me.

=> END


~ turn_in

Nyan: Excellent!
Nyan: You bought the Corn Seeds.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Nyan: Now I'll teach you how to farm.

do GameDialogueManager.action_teach_farming()

Nyan: First, till the soil.
Nyan: Then plant the Corn Seeds.
Nyan: Finally, water them every day.

do QuestManager.start_quest("first_harvest")

=> END


~ completed

Nyan: Good luck with your first harvest!

=> END